# Rhovanion Rampager {2}{B} (paid exactly with Mox Jet and Mana Crypt, Black Lotus kept for later): "Whenever this creature attacks, you may sacrifice another
# creature. If you do, put a number of +1/+1 counters on this creature equal to the sacrificed creature's power." Meager Meal (paid with Black Lotus, so something has left the battlefield before the sacrifice) has made
# Bot1's Memnite a 2/2 (printed power 1), and the Rampager cannot sacrifice itself (refused). Sacrificing the Memnite gives 2
# counters - its power as it last existed on the battlefield - so the Rampager is a 5/4 and hits Bot2 for 5 (15).

